# Binary assets: never run line-ending conversion (core.autocrlf=true would turn
# LF into CRLF on checkout for "text-looking" binaries — e.g. the byte-accurate
# PDF fixture whose xref offsets depend on 1-byte LFs — and corrupt them).
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary